                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Simple and VERY HARD wave shooter where robots come after you.\n\nYou start in a fixed position, from which you cant move, then different kind of robots start coming at you.\n\nTo fight them off you have a turret that gets heated the more you shoot, a rifle with unlimited magazines you have to manually reload, a bunch of Grenades and a shield (weapons can change depending on the level)\n\nOnce you get killed the game ends and you can choose a different level (6 to choose from).\n\nGraphics are nice the sound is great, you can actually know which way the enemies are coming from hearing them, and performance was decent.\n\nBut as i said... this game is HARD, i dont know if the leaderboards have been live since release, but at the time of playing i got a first place position on one of the levels with only 5 kills, the most kills anyone has on any level is 11... So yeah, they are pretty hard robots to beat.\n\nWhile the game is pretty well done, with ok graphics and sound, Even as a free game, I think the Extreme difficulty level sucks out all the enjoyment you might get out of it, so i cant really recommend this except for masochists or something.",
